{"id":"f014900b96c13a60","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-thm-mordell-conjecture.md","title":"Mordell Conjecture","display":"thm-mordell-conjecture — Mordell Conjecture","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-mordell-conjecture","aliases":["58-thm-mordell-conjecture"],"display":"thm-mordell-conjecture — Mordell Conjecture","depends_on":["[[58-df-field-extension]]","[[58-df-finite]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-mordell-conjecture"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-mordell-conjecture</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-mordell-conjecture — Mordell Conjecture"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"699918fd54cc2a8e\" href=\"?note=699918fd54cc2a8e\" title=\"58-df-field-extension\">58-df-field-extension</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d9a25b0ac94a3598\" href=\"?note=d9a25b0ac94a3598\" title=\"58-df-finite\">58-df-finite</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K,C,g,C_K\\in V\">\\(K,C,g,C_K\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,\\mathbb Q)\">\\(\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,\\mathbb Q)\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[K:\\mathbb Q]\\in\\omega\">\\([K:\\mathbb Q]\\in\\omega\\)</span> expresses that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span> is a number field.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveGeometricallyIntegralCurve}_S(C,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveGeometricallyIntegralCurve}_S(C,K)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgebraicCurveGenus}_S(g,C,K)\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgebraicCurveGenus}_S(g,C,K)\\)</span> are the algebraic-curve predicates.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C_K=\\{P\\in C:\\mathrm{CoordinatesIn}_S(P,K)\\}\">\\(C_K=\\{P\\in C:\\mathrm{CoordinatesIn}_S(P,K)\\}\\)</span> is the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K\">\\(K\\)</span>-rational point set, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}\\)</span> is the registered finiteness predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mordell}\\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,\\mathbb Q)\\land[K:\\mathbb Q]\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveGeometricallyIntegralCurve}_S(C,K)\\land\\mathrm{AlgebraicCurveGenus}_S(g,C,K)\\land2\\leq g\\land C_K=\\{P\\in C:\\mathrm{CoordinatesIn}_S(P,K)\\}\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(C_K).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mordell}\\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,\\mathbb Q)\\land[K:\\mathbb Q]\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveGeometricallyIntegralCurve}_S(C,K)\\land\\mathrm{AlgebraicCurveGenus}_S(g,C,K)\\land2\\leq g\\land C_K=\\{P\\in C:\\mathrm{CoordinatesIn}_S(P,K)\\}\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(C_K).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Faltings (1983): Mordell conjecture proved.</li>\n<li>The rational-point set is an explicit set parameter, and its conclusion uses the sourced finiteness predicate.</li>\n<li>The genus is the algebraic genus over the number field, not the unrelated compact-Riemann-surface predicate previously imported by name.</li>\n<li>Vojta (1987): Nevanlinna theory analog gives another proof.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-field-extension","status":"resolved","id":"699918fd54cc2a8e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"d9a25b0ac94a3598","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-finite]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,C,g,C_K\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,\\mathbb Q)","display":false},{"tex":"[K:\\mathbb Q]\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveGeometricallyIntegralCurve}_S(C,K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgebraicCurveGenus}_S(g,C,K)","display":false},{"tex":"C_K=\\{P\\in C:\\mathrm{CoordinatesIn}_S(P,K)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"K","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Finite}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}mordell}\\vdash \\mathrm{FieldExtension}_S(K,\\mathbb Q)\\land[K:\\mathbb Q]\\in\\omega\\land\\mathrm{SmoothProjectiveGeometricallyIntegralCurve}_S(C,K)\\land\\mathrm{AlgebraicCurveGenus}_S(g,C,K)\\land2\\leq g\\land C_K=\\{P\\in C:\\mathrm{CoordinatesIn}_S(P,K)\\}\\to\\mathrm{Finite}(C_K).","display":true}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-thm-mordell-conjecture.md|58-thm-mordell-conjecture]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["699918fd54cc2a8e","d9a25b0ac94a3598"]}